	"FriendlyName": "Repo Reader Oracle",
	"Description": "Editor-only, read-only bridge that reports a Blueprint's native editor state as JSON so ue-repo-reader's own binary decoding can be compared against the engine's own truth. Requires Unreal Engine 5.7 or newer. Captures nothing by compiling, saving or modifying assets.",
